  "prompt": "Start MAME from {anchor}opt/fury/mamed, system spacefury, ROMs in {anchor}opt/fury/roms, reference image {anchor}opt/fury/roms/fury.bin at the default address and base. Wait up to 12.5 seconds for the stub, on port 5731, with the ini files in {anchor}opt/fury/ini. Run the boot Lua harness {anchor}opt/fury/boot.lua (it prints the FURY_MODE environment variable) with FURY_MODE set to attract. Keep the states in {anchor}opt/fury/states, use the cfg file {anchor}opt/fury/cfg/spacefury.cfg, fly flat out until frame 1800 and run at real speed from there, with the types file {anchor}opt/fury/fury.types (no symbol file).",
